# Width re-check for the ids whose first test used all-zero multi-byte values (an all-zero tail can re-align by chance).
# These values make a too-short read leave "0x20 0x9f" behind, which swallows the canary.
waitsession 240
wait s2c 9 90
sleep 12
s2c 9 c:5 c:1
sleep 1.5
shot ref-01
